# Pine City Zoo 🐾

Pine City Zoo is a beginner-friendly HTML and CSS project that showcases a virtual zoo experience. It was created as part of a web development learning journey.

## 🌟 Features

- Simple homepage (`index.html`) with navigation
- Animal information pages like `animals.html` and `animals-elephants.html`
- Clean and structured layout using custom CSS
- Responsive design for better viewing on different devices

